{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/891718b8f817e0a71bd776cb1b1086e57f0bff7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3x+2)(4x-5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"18\" /> is equal to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/4/69480802fc35dba1868f22e1bbacdde4dddd1023.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad 12x^2-10 \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad 12x^2-23x-10 \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad 12x^3+7x-10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"479\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/e/7be6ab1b67bd340dcf7c9be8eb57c0418dc013fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)} \\quad 12x^2-7x-10 \\quad \\text{(E) NOTA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"254\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Use the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=FOIL\" title=\"FOIL\">FOIL</a> method to expand:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/8/ce80b61638e105363b523f1ca223497efb105a97.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(3x+2)(4x-5) = 12x^2 + 8x- 15x - 10 = \\boxed{12x^2- 7x-10}\\]\" width=\"475\" height=\"28\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/c/65cd215e7fc7eb8c86d72d653a4c76ee1158d85e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(D)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_5\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 5\"> Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_7\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041713\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: